    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo. 21 Cluain Aoibhinn Court; a superbly located one bedroom first floor apartment with views over Swellan Lake. \nA bright and well-proportioned apartment extending to 59 sq. m. approx. of comfortable accommodation to include; entrance hall with cloak press, open plan kitchen / dining / living room with private balcony, double bedroom with built in wardrobes and bathroom. \nEasily accessible to a range of excellent services and amenities within Cavan town by foot, car or local transport links. Cavan General Hospital and Farnham Estate Spa & Resort are within 4km of the property. \nAn ideal property for first-time buyers, those looking to downsize, or investors seeking an attractive investment opportunity with strong potential returns.\nViewing is recommended by appointment only with the sole selling agent."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nCarpet flooring, cloak press / hotpress.\n\nDining / Living Room - 6.73m x 3.38m\nCarpet flooring, double patio doors to balcony.\n\nKitchen - 3.20m x 2.90m\nVinyl flooring, fitted modern kitchen.\n\nBathroom - 3.50m x 1.70m\nPart tiled, bath, w.c, vanity basin.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.50m x 3.25m\nCarpet flooring, built in wardrobes.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Off-street parking.</li><li>Intercom system.</li><li>Electric storage heating.</li><li>Local bus link at entrance to the development- C3 Route.</li><li>Mains water and sewerage.</ul>"
      },
